WEBVTT

00:03:28.721 --> 00:03:30.782
These early affiliations,

00:03:30.806 --> 00:03:33.846
they often shared
identical characteristics,

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.750
which is rather baffling

00:03:35.774 --> 00:03:39.263
given how scattered we were
all over the planet.

00:03:39.287 --> 00:03:43.328
We constructed similar rituals,
practices and behaviors

00:03:43.352 --> 00:03:48.459
no matter where we were
anywhere on the globe.

00:03:48.483 --> 00:03:54.125
We constructed rituals
to create symbolic logos.

00:03:54.149 --> 00:03:56.614
We built environments for worship.

00:03:56.638 --> 00:04:00.831
We developed strict rules
on how to engage with each other